02:02.280 --> 02:05.114
SEPTEMBER SKIES

02:25.364 --> 02:26.697
What's got you in such a frazzle?

02:30.155 --> 02:32.030
I understand how you want
to show them your enthusiasm,

02:32.822 --> 02:35.572
but you're not showing them your best qualities.

02:37.114 --> 02:39.447
Well, the way you are now,

02:39.447 --> 02:42.030
you won't be much of a rival to Youko.

02:48.864 --> 02:52.489
It's intimidating when a big truck
moves in next to you, isn't it?

02:53.364 --> 02:55.739
But if you worry about it too much,

02:55.739 --> 02:59.030
the truck ends up dominating
all of your thoughts.

02:59.489 --> 03:02.989
If it hits us, we're the ones who'll get flattened.

03:02.989 --> 03:05.322
So, you gotta pull away, whatever it takes!

03:10.614 --> 03:13.155
You floor it and pull ahead!

03:13.739 --> 03:16.947
But there's a technique to it.

03:18.322 --> 03:20.447
You can't pull it off as you are now.

03:20.447 --> 03:24.072
So, just don't look at the truck, and do your best-

03:24.197 --> 03:26.947
I am! That's what I'm trying to do!

03:27.780 --> 03:31.364
But it's no use! I've given it everything!

03:31.739 --> 03:33.697
I can't do any more!

03:33.697 --> 03:35.614
Then quit.

03:35.864 --> 03:39.114
I don't need talent like that.

03:52.405 --> 03:54.280
Ooizumi!

03:56.697 --> 03:58.530
Good mornfterning!

03:58.530 --> 04:00.655
Hey there. No shoot today?

04:00.655 --> 04:02.780
We're doing it tomorrow.

04:03.155 --> 04:04.864
Another change?

04:04.864 --> 04:08.405
Yeah. It was because of the
Scarlet scene yesterday.

04:10.322 --> 04:12.364
It was moved to today.

04:12.822 --> 04:15.697
I see... Which stage are they using?

04:15.947 --> 04:17.239
16.

04:17.239 --> 04:19.155
Gotcha. See ya!

04:19.155 --> 04:20.530
Ooizumi!

04:20.530 --> 04:22.322
Sorry! I'm in a hurry!

04:22.739 --> 04:25.280
Miku, I'm sorry, but I...

04:26.030 --> 04:27.739
I love Natsumi!

04:27.739 --> 04:29.489
Ooizumi!

04:29.614 --> 04:33.697
Um, look, I... Um, I... You see...!

04:33.739 --> 04:35.947
Sorry! I'm in a hurry!

04:42.280 --> 04:42.822
Huh?

04:48.947 --> 04:50.905
Huh? Finished?

04:50.905 --> 04:55.072
Yeah! We did so well today that
we finished in no time!

04:55.239 --> 04:57.197
Really? That's great!

05:00.155 --> 05:01.447
So, I was waiting.

05:03.780 --> 05:05.697
Hey, wanna go somewhere today?

05:05.697 --> 05:07.114
What, right now?

05:07.114 --> 05:09.614
Let's go! I want to! Okay?

05:11.197 --> 05:13.614
But, my making-of video...

05:14.572 --> 05:16.030
You can't?

05:19.489 --> 05:21.489
Like hell I can't! We'll go anywhere you like!

05:34.405 --> 05:37.405
Everybody has them inside of their heart

05:37.655 --> 05:40.989
Feelings that they'd like to change

05:40.989 --> 05:44.239
It'd be nice if you were used to them all the time

05:43.280 --> 05:44.947
What about the train?

05:44.239 --> 05:47.780
And be a wonderful heroine

05:44.947 --> 05:47.822
We've got plenty of time. Look!

05:47.780 --> 05:50.739
Why, oh, why?

05:48.239 --> 05:52.405
We've got that much time?

05:48.240 --> 05:52.405
Okay, then! Let's do it again!

05:50.739 --> 05:54.364
Why does my heart tremble so?

05:52.405 --> 05:53.864
Yeah!

05:54.364 --> 06:00.614
I'm changing from the person I was!

05:56.489 --> 05:57.864
From the person!

06:00.905 --> 06:05.989
My hidden charm is infinite!

06:05.572 --> 06:06.989
Infinite!

06:07.447 --> 06:12.614
When dreams and courage are joined

06:12.155 --> 06:13.739
Are joined!

06:14.197 --> 06:17.655
I want to, want to, want to change!

06:17.864 --> 06:20.822
Wow. We sang a lot!

06:20.822 --> 06:23.780
I'm beat, but it was a lot of fun!

06:26.030 --> 06:27.822
Well, time to go home.

06:29.864 --> 06:32.614
Oh, crap! We missed the last train!

06:32.614 --> 06:33.697
Oh.

06:33.697 --> 06:36.155
What do you mean, "oh"?

06:33.698 --> 06:36.155
Do you money for a taxi?

06:36.905 --> 06:38.030
Uh-uh.

06:38.030 --> 06:41.822
Uh-uh? Oh, man, this is bad!

06:42.572 --> 06:46.072
I'm sorry. I completely lost track of the time.

06:46.072 --> 06:47.114
It's okay.

06:47.114 --> 06:48.030
Huh?

06:48.197 --> 06:51.572
I misread the time on purpose.

06:52.072 --> 06:53.489
But... Why?

06:54.489 --> 06:56.447
Why do you think?

06:58.739 --> 07:00.280
This is...!

07:00.280 --> 07:02.864
This is a plot development
straight out of a men's comic!

07:03.489 --> 07:08.030
Hold it! It might be the pattern for getting
her undressed, like in a soft-core manga.

07:08.489 --> 07:11.739
But wait! This feels like
a decision point in a dating sim...

07:09.537 --> 07:14.489
NATSUMI - "Why do you think?"

07:11.739 --> 07:15.530
where you have to join hands or
else you can't proceed in the story!

07:14.621 --> 07:15.489
NATSUMI - "You wuss!"

07:15.739 --> 07:17.447
Gah! What do I do?!

07:26.864 --> 07:30.364
N-No way! Are you sure?

07:40.364 --> 07:43.905
So, this is what they're like.

07:40.365 --> 07:43.905
I've only heard about these places.

07:44.239 --> 07:48.572
So... That's one of those and
this is one of these...

07:48.572 --> 07:51.114
This is no time to be thinking about that!

07:51.114 --> 07:53.364
Yagami... What's gotten into you?

07:53.364 --> 07:54.530
Should I go first?

07:54.530 --> 07:57.322
Huh? Um... Sure.

08:11.530 --> 08:13.155
"I am Lin-Lan!"

08:13.155 --> 08:14.322
Ooizumi?

08:14.322 --> 08:14.905
YES?!

08:18.364 --> 08:19.739
Thanks for today.

08:20.322 --> 08:21.905
Your turn.

08:21.905 --> 08:23.364
S-sure.

08:25.114 --> 08:28.405
Okay, how do I run with this?

08:28.447 --> 08:30.197
Do that?

08:30.197 --> 08:33.822
No, wait. This is my first time, so maybe...

08:33.822 --> 08:39.280
Still, all the magazines say
that's the best way to do it.

08:40.947 --> 08:42.530
TOO HOT!

08:52.072 --> 08:53.697
Were you...waiting?

08:54.947 --> 08:56.447
Uh-uh.

08:59.530 --> 09:00.989
Look...

09:02.655 --> 09:04.572
I...

09:07.364 --> 09:08.989
Wh-what is it?

09:09.905 --> 09:12.489
Is she suddenly getting scared?

09:14.614 --> 09:16.947
Or... She's just nervous, I guess.

09:31.280 --> 09:33.155
You know...

09:34.364 --> 09:36.780
Maybe we shouldn't do this.

09:44.489 --> 09:46.655
You're so nice.

09:46.655 --> 09:48.197
It's just...

09:52.030 --> 09:53.322
Ooizumi!

09:53.322 --> 09:54.072
Yes?

09:54.072 --> 09:56.905
Hold me.

09:58.530 --> 09:59.405
Sure.

10:18.364 --> 10:22.030
Um... Should we... start with your breasts?

10:24.405 --> 10:27.030
I don't know. I've heard, but...

10:27.905 --> 10:30.822
Well... Let's go with that for now.

10:38.405 --> 10:40.489
I'm kind of...

10:42.322 --> 10:44.572
I'm nervous, you know?

10:50.572 --> 10:51.489
May I?

10:54.739 --> 10:55.905
Sure.

11:02.364 --> 11:04.905
You're so pretty.

11:07.489 --> 11:10.239
I don't want anyone to see you this way.

11:18.572 --> 11:22.322
I want lots of people to see you
as a shrine maiden...

11:22.655 --> 11:24.989
But this sight of you now is mine alone.

11:28.530 --> 11:29.905
No!

11:34.489 --> 11:35.405
Yagami...

11:35.572 --> 11:38.572
I'm sorry. I just can't.

11:39.989 --> 11:42.322
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

11:43.822 --> 11:45.447
It's okay.

11:47.197 --> 11:49.905
I'm kind of relieved, too.

11:55.989 --> 11:57.322
Nobody around?

11:57.322 --> 11:59.447
No. I think it's safe now.

11:59.697 --> 12:00.447
Ready?

12:00.447 --> 12:02.072
And... go!

12:03.239 --> 12:05.989
Oh! You're doing morning training, too?

12:05.989 --> 12:09.572
Yup! Gotta work, work, work!

12:09.572 --> 12:10.864
Same here! Same here!

12:17.322 --> 12:19.572
I feel like we're actors.

12:19.572 --> 12:21.822
You ARE an actor!

12:22.030 --> 12:23.114
Yeah, that's right.

12:27.530 --> 12:29.322
Anyway, I'll walk you to the station.

12:29.322 --> 12:31.322
You know, I just realized.

12:31.322 --> 12:32.155
What?

12:32.155 --> 12:34.697
I lost my umbrella somewhere.

12:34.697 --> 12:37.030
Oh? Now that you mention it, so did I.

